INITECH SYSTEMS CORPORATION                                                 
MEMORANDUM                                                                  
                                                                            
TO:       All Department Staff                                              
FROM:     Bill Lumbergh                                                     
DATE:     March 2, 1992                                                     
SUBJECT:  TPS Report Cover Sheets                                           
                                                                            
Beginning Monday, every TPS report must go out with the new cover           
sheet. The change takes effect immediately. The cover sheets are            
in the supply room on the third floor, next to the copier.                  
                                                                            
If you have questions about the cover sheets, please see me or              
Milton Waddams in collating.                                                
                                                                            
Reports without a cover sheet will be returned.                             
                                                                            
Please read the attached instructions before Monday.                        
                                                                            
                                                                            
                                                                            
                                                                            
                                                                            
